WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:06.910
Still unseen by anyone

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:09.790
In the midst of my dreams

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:17.750
The sweet desire I found is here today as well

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:26.120
From inside of me

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.000
Someone screams at you to notice

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:37.830
We stare at one another, at an irritating distance

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:41.080
Alone, I endure

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.040
The onslaught of sadness

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:48.950
Though I want to tell you this feeling of love

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:54.080
I can't say a word

00:00:54.080 --> 00:01:00.830
Though you're always at my side

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.160
Still unseen by anyone

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:09.200
In the midst of my dreams

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:13.040
A strong emotion set aflame

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:19.450
I won't hesitate, I don't want to hesitate

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:24.410
I'll believe in now, and take a step forward

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:28.870
For the sake of myself

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:35.620
What is it you wanted to tell me, Father?

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.250
Listen closely, Gelhilde.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.830
What I am about to say,
you must always bear in mind.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.410
You are weak.

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:58.250
Summon the castle wall.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:05.870
Alright. We're going to
sneak around the back, Lover.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.450
R-right!

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:14.290
To get straight to the point,
we cannot beat the Norn.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:19.330
As we are, we don't stand a chance against
those akuma and their method of annihilation.

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.040
If there were only one or two of them
it'd be no problem, though.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.870
Then that means...

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.250
Yes.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.620
We will kill her lover Snorri,
and leave the Norn powerless.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:34.410
When the Norn attacks, we'll launch a surprise attack
from the back and bring her down.

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.500
Since Natsuki can't fight, I'll do it.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:43.540
At that time, Futaba, distract all of the akuma
so they won't catch wind of my movements.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.750
Leave it to me!

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.750
Huh? Are you sure, Futaba?

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.160
Come on, who do you think I am?

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:55.000
But doing all that at your level, Futaba...

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.410
You worry too much, Misa-chan.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.120
That weakling is the problem here.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.950
I can transform for about a second.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:07.250
In that case, it's essential that you
go together with Takuma-chan, right?

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:12.000
I'm actually unsure as to whether that weakling
is prepared to take a step towards death or not.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.000
Huh?

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:16.580
E-excuse me!

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.540
Perfect timing.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.910
We need to ask you a favor concerning the Norn.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.620
About that...

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:26.540
I think I have no choice but to attack them.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.580
Huh?

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.700
That Norn seems very strong, but, uh... well...

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:36.120
if we can disable her lover,
I think it might work out somehow...and...

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.540
So, uh...

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.910
What?!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.290
I guess I wouldn't be able to...

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.200
What's with this sudden change?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:47.830
So you're ready to to save the world
in your own spineless way now?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.290
Uh...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.500
Well...

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.250
Well, it's fine.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.620
In that case, go get ready for this immediately.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:58.540
Before I stab your ass to death.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.540
Calm down, Big Sis Ichika.

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.660
Get ready?

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.950
Well then, shall we get started, Takuma-chan?

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:12.950
Val Love, "Embrace Without a Stitch of Clothing On
and Kiss Passionately for 5 Minutes"!

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:19.410
There you go.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:25.160
This time, if we aren't in EX mode from the start,
this will be hard to accomplish.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.120
I-I see!

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:31.700
Do you hate older women?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:37.870
N-no! I just thought you were
strong enough to not need to do this.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.910
You are Her Majesty, after all.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.330
That isn't true at all.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.580
Because I'm weak.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.660
Shall we get started now?

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.500
Val Love, commence.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:01.120
Takuma-chan, relax.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:13.700
I have to do my best!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:21.660
Takuma-chan, you may be a little too ravenous!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.790
I-I-I'm sorry! I just...

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:31.540
But you know, I like people that will do this
to try to become stronger.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:38.750
Please, don't ever lose that desire.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.830
Summon double castle wall!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.160
She's been engaging in only
hand to hand combat this whole time!

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.200
What happened to that castle she's so proud of?!

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:03.000
I wondered what type of person you were,
since you're exalted as a main god or "Her Majesty."

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.370
Is Einheijer incompetent?

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:08.000
Or have you always been this weak?

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.830
Or perhaps both?

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:13.450
Well, at any rate, We are simply
too strong for you, aren't We!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:15.540
Of course, Our Lady.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:17.540
Yes, that's right!

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:20.830
You've been chattering on for quite some time now.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:24.290
Hurry up and come at me, you little brat.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.160
Such impolite language...

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.910
Massacre them!

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:31.660
Stop, Lover.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.290
A surveillance akuma.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.410
I thought they'd set one up.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.160
This way.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:46.370
Uh, okay.

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:54.200
If we don't hurry, Futaba's castle will fall.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.950
Why doesn't Futaba-san attack with her castle?

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.250
It isn't that she won't use it, but she can't.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.080
Huh?

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.040
Have you heard about the aether?

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.370
U-uh, yeah.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:08.410
The aether is like their souls,

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:12.750
and the more aether they have,
the stronger the ability they can use, right?

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.500
In simple terms, that's correct.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:18.950
The amount of aether Futaba has
is considerably small.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.370
She is easily the weakest of the sisters.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.370
Huh?

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.950
The castle is the ability to summon Valhalla,
the fortress of the aether.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:32.330
With the perfect amount of aether, she can call forth
all sorts of aether weapons including a war cry,

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:35.700
but Futaba can't do that
with the amount of aether she has.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:41.000
A higher level would be better, but at her current level
the most she can do is summon the outer walls.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:44.370
Therefore, Futaba has no choice
but to fight barehanded.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.250
I-I don't believe it.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:49.790
That's precisely why Futaba got stronger.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:53.500
In order for her to hold her own
even with her weak abilities in a fight with enemies,

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.910
she became a disciple of Thor and trained hard.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.040
Since her vision is blocked,
she also honed her senses.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.660
Futaba is not worthy of being called "Her Majesty"
due to her physical strength.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:10.160
It's due to the strength of her heart that will
never allow anyone to set foot inside our castle!

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.950
Big Sister Futaba!

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:25.200
I am...

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:25.660
I am...

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:25.950
weak.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:26.620
weak.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.700
I am...
weak.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.950
The aggression of the spear and the blade;

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.790
the specialty of the chain and the wing;

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.040
the versatility of the thread and of sound...

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.330
I have none of that.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.910
Even so, I swear I will protect my family!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.830
Mere drivel.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.950
Just die and let me through!

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.500
I'm going to take a look.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.700
Do not fail, Lover!

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:00.290
Got it!

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:06.080
Okay, off to round two!

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.830
Yamada-san, you're drinking too much!

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.660
Ugh, you sound like my dumbass son!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:14.540
The streets have been dangerous lately,
so let's head home now.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.950
Oh? What was it again?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.580
It was something about akuma or...

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.410
Are you alright, Big Sister Shino?

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.660
Our father once prophesized:

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:44.950
Those who lie idle
tend to be unable to claim victory.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:49.410
A barrier has been granted, born from my body.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:55.000
The Helmet That Transcends Time
(Bergelmir)

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.500
If I cannot fight...

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.410
If this is how it must be... then I will withstand it.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:59.290
Until my body gives out... and only then.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.950
There are four eggs left.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:19.910
Including the akuma at our feet,
taking them all on would be a challenge.

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:23.330
We'll wait until the Norn has
more of her attention on Futaba.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.120
G-got it.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.200
I guess this much fortification around us

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:31.950
is challenging for Ichika since her transformation
is effective for one second.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:36.830
There are four eggs left?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:40.120
Um, are there really only four left?

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.250
What?

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.660
I can't sense anything!
Don't spout useless things at me, you weakling!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.200
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:59.160
What could this be? Something doesn't feel right.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.450
Futaba-san!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.370
This is my fault.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:14.160
A higher level would be better,
but at her current level...

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.370
If I had been more thorough,

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:21.910
I'm sure I would have been able to
raise Futaba's abilities!

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.620
If I were more reliable,

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:29.290
then both Futaba-san and Ichika-san
would be at a high enough level from the start!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.830
I'd also be able to restore Natsuki-san's AP.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:36.750
More than two of them would be able
to transform right now!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.910
This is all because of me!

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:48.620
Is it time yet?

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:52.540
At this rate, Futaba-san will...

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.330
Not yet.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:55.620
But-

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:57.200
Not yet.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.620
Not yet!

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:31.950
If there's no smashing through the castle
or breaching the barrier, what do we do?

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.040
Dumplings are so tasty.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:38.870
Despite what you say, it's only a matter of time
before the Valkyrie of the castle collapses.

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.910
At this rate, I think it is a good idea
to take our time attacking her.

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.620
I know that!

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:48.910
Though you're at such a high level,
you can't take me down on your own.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:51.910
She must be a failure after all...

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.450
Aren't you, lover?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.450
Our Lady?

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:00.120
Take a note, Roskva.

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:04.160
A noble will not give in to cheap provocation.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:06.660
However...

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.540
ridiculing Roskva will not be tolerated!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.790
The gods dread that spear.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:22.500
While it is the counterpart of her body,
and while it's power is a mere flicker.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.660
All of creation is in that one spear.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:30.330
That body will undoubtedly become bright red!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.040
She really is a strong Norn.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.370
However...

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.330
now I have Snorri to myself!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.250
I knew something was off!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.950
This uneasiness that I've been feeling...

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.040
when we first encountered the Norn,

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.830
there were twenty-one eggs in all.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:53.660
But now, after her summons,
there are only twenty!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.620
There's one egg missing!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.790
I have confidence in my memory.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:01.160
I'm positive I have the number of eggs right!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.790
Then that means...

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.040
The last egg is...

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.700
What are y-

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.790
That wasn't very wise, Valkyrie.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:22.000
It was clear that you, Valkyrie of inferior strength,
would aim for me.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:25.540
Therefore, I let it hatch inside of me.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:29.500
It seems you've been able to avoid the akuma,
but unfortunately for you...

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.700
I am also an akuma.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.370
Roskva.

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:46.370
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:51.450
There are two aether responses to the northwest.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:54.200
So they've managed to escape, huh?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.660
But Einheijer's abilities are yet to be awakened.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:01.250
It should still take some time
for the misteltein to sprout,

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:04.580
so these idiotic beasts are inferior to even ants.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.790
Now then, time to hunt Einheijer!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.750
I can't believe she's trying to unite with an akuma...

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.620
What a mistake I've made.

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:16.910
And what's more...
I'm being carried on this weakling's back!

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:20.120
Kitadai Park

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:23.120
L-let's hide here for now.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.660
Ichika-san can't move.

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:32.500
Now that it's come to this, I have to...

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.040
invoke my abilities!

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.080
Dammit!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.830
Why can't I even do it at a time like this?!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.910
How long will I stay like this?!

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.410
Lover...

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:52.500
Leave me behind.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:53.580
Huh?

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:56.870
Go back to the house and regroup.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.830
Einheijer is the heart of the Valkyrie.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.410
We can't lose you here.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.750
Misa is in command.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.910
Do as I say.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.700
B-but...

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.370
Don't get arrogant, Lover.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.250
This does not mean that I have
accepted you in the slightest.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.870
It is all for the sake of my dear sisters

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.790
that you have survived so long here.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.000
If you understand, then go.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.000
I leave my sisters to you.

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.580
No... I won't!

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:43.700
No...

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:44.660
No...
I won't!

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:52.290
What the hell are you doing?!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:57.370
I am extremely sorry to say this,
but to be honest,

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.000
I don't like you, Ichika-san.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:03.080
I shake under the ferocity of your formidable nature,

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:05.950
and your eyes are somehow scary.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.750
You're one to talk!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:12.700
But... without you, I'm sure everyone
would be heartbroken.

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:18.830
So I absolutely will not leave you behind!

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.950
You mean you're trying to make it so I can fight?

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:28.870
You're telling me to level up as quickly as possible?

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:33.620
What a coincidence. I really hate you too,

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.500
but I don't want to see my sisters grieving.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.450
Alright, then!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:43.700
Come and seduce me right now, Lover!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.040
Val Love

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.950
Val Love, commence!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:05.750
H-how is it? I mean, does it feel good?

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:11.200
I'm not so easy of a woman
to be seduced to this degree of-

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:15.250
This is so shameful!

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.700
Can I really get stronger from this?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.540
I've never undertaken any love training,
so I have no idea!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:23.580
Run, Lover!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.910
They have evaded all of the bullets.

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:33.370
Keep firing!

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.410
On the right!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:37.250
Okay!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:06.790
My ideal man, Father?

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.410
Yes. Brunhilde, what type of man do you prefer?

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:16.080
As a Valkyrie, you've dreamt of
your future mate, haven't you?

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:18.790
Einheijer...

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:24.040
By the way, I personally like long,
dark hair like your mother's!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:28.120
She's the perfect example of the
"ideal woman of virtue" I've heard about!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:31.750
Let me see... At the very least...

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:37.200
weak, rude, and shallow guys
are the ones I definitely can't stand!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.160
Just thinking about 'em makes me wanna puke!

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.080
Please don't break the game pieces.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:45.120
I don't need a lover.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:48.750
I'm beyond competent in fighting
with this one spear.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.450
You know for sure how strong I am, right, Father?

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:58.830
But I want my sisters to meet a good man.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:05.660
He doesn't need to be strong,
but if he disregards himself in favor of my sisters,

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:10.870
and never backs down from a steadfast spear,
then he's surely good enough for my sisters.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:14.040
So even you have one!

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.330
You do have a preferred type of man!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.200
Val Love
Val Love...

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:29.660
Accept the Lover

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.830
"Accept the Lover," successful.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.370
Successful

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:36.330
Impact confirmed.

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:38.910
That was a lot of trouble.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:42.790
There's no way they're still alive,
but what do you think, Roskva?

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:43.540
Yes ma'am.

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:46.790
Our Lady!

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:53.000
What... The Valkyrie of the spear?!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.750
She should be completely powerless!

00:20:56.660 --> 00:21:01.120
I am not prepared for something like
saving the world.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.540
But...

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.410
Even so...

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:08.950
I swear I will guard all of your lives!

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.450
Because I...

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.580
I love you all.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.540
Someone once said:

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.870
Someone once said

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.290
"Love is the source of a maiden's power.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.830
Love is the source of a maiden's power.

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:27.370
However, it is impossible for a maiden

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:26.370
However, it is impossible for a maiden

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.750
to sustain that love alone!"

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.120
to sustain that love alone

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.950
Einheijer
Book Lv. 10

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:39.450
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:42.700
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:49.250
If we don't understand love,
you & I won't get anywhere, you know?

00:21:50.790 --> 00:22:01.750
Nine times out of love on cloud nine

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.750
We wanna share your heart!

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.000
(How do you tell me?)
Input sweet nothings

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:10.200
Failed - Cancelled - They don't resonate at all
(Please don't be shy)

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:13.410
(How to make dream)
Touch me and bring me one

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:17.040
Successful - Complete - Isn't cutting-edge tech great?
(Hold me tight)

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:22.540
Why won't you say romance?

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:25.580
Let's bring it to love!

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:32.750
Get more experience and level up my maiden heart

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:37.450
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:40.790
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.750
I'll teach you that love is a maiden's power!
(Love gave the power to Valkyrie)

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:50.290
Nine times out of ten, they're surely already lovers!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:53.660
Fluttering in my chest, dance, dance!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:53.660 --> 00:22:56.870
Your shy akuma mind, kiss for you!

00:22:56.870 --> 00:23:00.080
Will completely change, kiss for me!

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:03.450
Let's begin our romance!

00:23:06.450 --> 00:23:08.950
Takuma, the clothes you're wearing...

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:12.620
is that the power of Einheijer's book?

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:13.950
I don't know.

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:16.000
I was thinking about all of you, and then...

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:17.500
Stay on guard, Lover!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.870
The enemy is that Norn and Snorri,
who's become an akuma!

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:21.410
Please, Takuma-chan.

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:24.040
The Lover is the only one who can heal the maidens.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:25.830
You can do it, Takuma-kun!

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:29.160
Takuma-san, you were the one chosen by our father.

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:30.660
We're counting on you, Takuma!

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:31.870
Big Brother Takuma!

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:32.950
Big Brother.

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:34.160
Master.

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:35.330
Takuma?

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:36.910
I-I'll do my best!

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:41.000
Next time: 
The Loving Maiden

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:39.450
Next time: "The Loving Maiden!"
